Fix thread safety, accessibility, and security in assistant-lab skill-app

This patch addresses critical issues in bridge.py and all QML files:
- Thread safety: QTimer.singleShot for all cross-thread signal emissions
- Security: Input validation with regex patterns and bounds checking
- Accessibility: id properties and Accessible.name on all interactive elements
- Memory safety: Null guards in QML, OSError handling in Python
- QML best practices: Property ordering (id→properties→sizing→anchors→visual→behaviors→children)

Note: Similar patterns should be applied to other skill-apps (classifier-lab,
conversation-lab, figure-lab, gpt-lab, pdf-lab, regressor-lab, streamdeck-lab).

